    "a552c4d607ee6ce6f948": "This is **Singapore**, a city-state in Southeast Asia.\n\nVisible landmarks and their positions:\n\n- **Marina Bay Sands** – On the left side of the image, this iconic hotel complex features three towers connected by a sky park at the top. It’s one of Singapore’s most recognizable structures.\n  \n- **Singapore Flyer** – On the right side, this is the world’s tallest Ferris wheel, standing prominently against the twilight sky. It offers panoramic views of the city.\n\n- **ArtScience Museum** – Located between Marina Bay Sands and the Singapore Flyer, its lotus-shaped building glows warmly at dusk.\n\n- **City skyline** – Behind these landmarks, a dense cluster of modern skyscrapers forms the urban backdrop, including buildings like the UOB Plaza and other financial district towers.\n\nThe scene is viewed from across Marina Bay, with the water reflecting the city lights and the soft hues of sunset or sunrise.",
