    "1a8744d5ff2e42790d0c": "This scene is from the 1997 film **Titanic**, directed by James Cameron.\n\nIn this iconic moment, Jack Dawson (Leonardo DiCaprio) and Rose DeWitt Bukater (Kate Winslet) are standing on the bow of the ship, arms outstretched, embracing the wind as the sun sets over the ocean. The warm golden light bathes them in a romantic glow, capturing a fleeting moment of freedom and connection before the tragedy unfolds. Their expressions convey awe, joy, and deep emotional intimacy — a powerful visual metaphor for their love story against the backdrop of impending disaster.",
