    "679306d28afc332de961": "This is **Singapore**, a city-state in Southeast Asia.\n\nVisible landmarks and their positions:\n\n- **Marina Bay Sands** – On the left side of the image, this iconic hotel features three towers connected by a sky park at the top. It’s one of Singapore’s most recognizable structures.\n  \n- **Singapore Flyer** – On the right side, this giant observation wheel stands tall against the twilight sky. It’s the tallest Ferris wheel in the Southern Hemisphere.\n\n- **ArtScience Museum** – Located between Marina Bay Sands and the Singapore Flyer, its lotus-like shape glows warmly at dusk.\n\n- **City skyline** – Behind these landmarks, a cluster of modern skyscrapers lines the waterfront, including buildings like the UOB Plaza and OCBC Centre (though not all are clearly labeled here).\n\nThe scene captures the Marina Bay area at sunset or early evening, with reflections shimmering on the water below — a popular vantage point for tourists and locals alike.",
