    "f0decb0d7ec6d7a36ef3": "This is a scene from the 1997 film **Titanic**.\n\nIn the image, the characters Jack (Leonardo DiCaprio) and Rose (Kate Winslet) are standing on the bow of the ship. Rose has her arms outstretched, leaning forward as if feeling the wind, while Jack stands behind her, holding her waist and looking at her with an expression of admiration. The background shows a vast ocean under a sunset sky.",
