    "0edc08c6f9f5bcb84c42": "This is a scene from the 1997 film **Titanic**.\n\nIn the image, the characters Jack (Leonardo DiCaprio) and Rose (Kate Winslet) are standing on the bow of the ship. Rose has her arms outstretched to the sides with an expression of joy and excitement, while Jack stands behind her, holding her waist and looking at her with an affectionate expression. They are positioned against a backdrop of a sunset over the ocean.",
