    "2104cffb16ecd36c3178": "This image is from the 1997 film **Titanic**.\n\nThe scene shows the characters Jack (Leonardo DiCaprio) and Rose (Kate Winslet) standing at the bow of the ship. Jack is holding Rose from behind as she leans forward with her arms outstretched, looking out over the ocean at the sunset.",
