    "4976dfedaf5f78fabef8": "Based on the visible ingredients in the image, here are the components needed to make this pizza:\n\n**Dough Ingredients:**\n- Flour (likely high-gluten or “00” flour for Neapolitan-style pizza)\n- Water\n- Yeast (instant or active dry)\n- Salt\n- Possibly a small amount of olive oil or sugar (optional, not always visible but common)\n\n**Toppings:**\n- Tomato sauce (likely San Marzano tomatoes, crushed or pureed)\n- Fresh mozzarella cheese (or low-moisture mozzarella, melted and bubbly)\n- Fresh basil leaves (added after baking, as they appear bright green and unwilted)\n\nThis is a classic Margherita pizza — simple, traditional, and visually consistent with its namesake: red (tomato), white (mozzarella), and green (basil). No other toppings are visible.",
